  "government": "National/ACT/New Zealand First Coalition Government",
  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2024-12-12T03:57:39Z\"\u003e12 December 2024\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  NZGIF update \n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"teaser--small minister taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-ministers taxonomy-term--view-mode-teaser-small ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \u003ca href=\"/minister/hon-simon-watts\" class=\"field-group-link minister__link\" hreflang=\"en\"\u003e    \n      \u003cdiv class=\"field minister__portrait\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\n  \n  \n            \u003cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e  \u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/2023-12/Watts.jpg?itok=WM2w1g8R\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" alt=\"Simon Watts portrait\" class=\"img-responsive\"/\u003e\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n  \n\n    \n      \u003cdiv class=\"field minister__title\"\u003e  Hon Simon Watts\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tag taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-portfolios taxonomy-term--view-mode-teaser-small ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    \u003ca href=\"/portfolio/nationalactnew-zealand-first-coalition-government-2023-2026/climate-change\" hreflang=\"en\"\u003eClimate Change\u003c/a\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCecilia Tarrant has announced she has resigned as Chair of New Zealand Green Investment Finance, Climate Change Minister Simon Watts says.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e“I want to acknowledge the work Ms Tarrant has led over the last six years and thank her for her service.”\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMs Tarrant will stand down with effect from 20 December. David Woods, the Deputy Chair of NZGIF, will act as Chair for the coming months while decisions are made on the future direction of NZGIF.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Cecilia Tarrant has announced she has resigned as Chair of New Zealand Green Investment Finance, Climate Change Minister Simon Watts says. “I want to acknowledge the work Ms Tarrant has led over the last six years and thank her for her service.” Ms Tarrant will stand down with effect from 20 December. David Woods, the Deputy Chair of NZGIF, will act as Chair for the coming months while decisions are made on the future direction of NZGIF.",
